53541	53611	53337	53337	she	110	" I did . He was insolent , as he always was ; for he hated me for having discovered that which shut him out from all claim upon my fortune . He hated himself for his folly in not having played his cards better . Angry words passed between us ; but it ended in his declaring his intention of starting for Liverpool early the next morning , and-- "
